# Violent Urge with delirium (CR 702.138 / 207.2c): on turn 1 Black Lotus pays for a Wheel of Fortune that puts Black Lotus (artifact),
# Wheel of Fortune (sorcery), an Ornithopter (artifact creature) and an Island (land) into Bot1's graveyard - four card types. On
# turn 3 the first Ornithopter (0/2 flier) attacks unblocked and Violent Urge, cast after attackers are declared, makes it
# 1/2 with first strike and double strike, so it deals 1 first-strike damage and 1 regular damage: 2 in all (the other scenario,
# one type short, deals 1). The pump and the keywords last only until end of turn (CR 611.2a), checked on turn 4.

